{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/60804381201589b02f85d36b7f41c3cd.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" width=1117 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/60804381201589b02f85d36b7f41c3cd.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ARTIUS: Pure Imagination is a fast-paced, momentum-based 2D platformer where you play as distinct artists with unique abilities, battling to preserve creativity in a world on the verge of artistic extinction!</strong> Dash, swing, and smash your way through a vibrant, hand-drawn world in this adrenaline-fueled platformer where style is your strongest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/9aea0f689806324dff0ea1871be4d819.avif?t=1768584276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras_big/9aea0f689806324dff0ea1871be4d819.webp?t=1768584276 width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rupestrine was a city renowned for its rich artistic history. The city earned its name thanks to the discovery of some of the oldest archaeological sites in the region, filled with cave paintings, petroglyphs, and other forms of rock art. Over time, this deep artistic heritage transformed the city into a cultural hub, attracting musicians, painters, sculptors, dancers, and all those involved in the fine arts.<strong> It was the home of our heroes: <u>Pierre the Painter</u>, <u>Walter the Photographer</u>, <u>Ren\u00e9 The Musician</u> and <u>Guga The Dancer</u>. They all studied at Rupestrine's EdAN Art University and lived fun, artistic lives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/dcfb7a5d01edaa8752cff0a88fef2293.avif?t=1768584276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras_big/dcfb7a5d01edaa8752cff0a88fef2293.webp?t=1768584276 width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One day, a jealous student named <u>PIVOLO</u>, envious of their talent and beloved by none, seized control of the mystical and magical ARTIUS book and imposed an anti-art regime over the city of Rupestrine</strong>, reshaping it according to his rigid and oppressive vision. As Pivolo\u2019s tyranny spreads, society begins to question the value of art itself, forgetting its power to inspire, heal, and bring people together.<strong> It falls upon four heroes: each wielding their own unique creative abilities to challenge this bleak new reality!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b4e2f40742f7fcce04bf33812233c7a.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b4e2f40742f7fcce04bf33812233c7a.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is losing its spark. Inspiration is fading. The forces of uniformity and oppression are closing in. <strong>But art will not go quietly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/32f199def43c182e98fdfc1c5ad336eb.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/32f199def43c182e98fdfc1c5ad336eb.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">That\u2019s where you come in! Take control of <strong>Pierre, Ren\u00e9, Walter and Guga: each representing a different artistic discipline</strong> and use their unique talents to restore color, music, and imagination to the world.\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the characters' high-speed movement actions to <strong>bolt your way through vibrant levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap between characters</strong> to unlock new paths, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden secrets in the levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b345e441fe32447c38962118b93511ad.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b345e441fe32447c38962118b93511ad.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a mix of high-speed platforming, stylish moves, and expressive gameplay, <strong>ARTIUS lets you dash, paint, compose and create your way through dynamic levels </strong>inspired by the very essence of art itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/3577e8351b45d4aedd00c278689118fc.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" width=464 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/3577e8351b45d4aedd00c278689118fc.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUN, JUMP &amp; EXPRESS YOURSELF</strong> in this blazing fast, momentum-driven platformer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSE YOURSELF</strong> in vibrant and immersive levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER </strong>the unique abilities of four distinct artists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNEARTH </strong>the secrets of Rupestrine and meet fantastical characters along your journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE OFF</strong> against surreal foes trying to erase artistry from existence!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/5c15cbc8d4eea7c14486569b256638ea.apng?t=1768584276\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/5c15cbc8d4eea7c14486569b256638ea.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" class=\"bb_img\" width=631 height=343 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599920?t=1768584276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599920?t=1768584276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/a2c693340f58e065f30222a4965ce7b1df7a0828/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768584276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/a2c693340f58e065f30222a4965ce7b1df7a0828/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768584276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/60804381201589b02f85d36b7f41c3cd.poster.avif?t=1768584276\" width=1117 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/60804381201589b02f85d36b7f41c3cd.webm?t=1768584276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ARTIUS: Pure Imagination is a fast-paced, momentum-based 2D platformer where you play as distinct artists with unique abilities, battling to preserve creativity in a world on the verge of artistic extinction!</s